  "description": "For 200 years, Amarzan the Great Sorcerer strived to become a god. So when he was told that he still lacked something, he chose to start over. Now, he has been reborn as Shuriah, one of the Brionia Empire's greatest beauties and Crown Prince Lenkaizer's maid. Despite trying to focus on finding what she lacked as Amarzan, Shuriah finds herself overcome with the urge to kill Lenkaizer whenever he shows her interest. Is she in danger, or is this just a new emotion she's never experienced before?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
